--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+> **内置 Bangumi 动画元数据**：此 Fork 在 App 内用 Swift 原生实现 Bangumi（bgm.tv），接入首页、搜索和动画详情。它与 AniList、MyAnimeList、Simkl 一起出现在首页来源菜单和模块页，无需导入模块 URL、下载脚本或登录。
+>
+> [构建、安装与验证记录](docs/BANGUMI.md) · [Bangumi 模块仓库](https://github.com/quiteQa/shirox-bangumi)
+>
+> 安装此版本后，在首页来源菜单或模块页直接选择 **Bangumi**。读取内容仍需连接 api.bgm.tv。下方保留的上游安装链接指向官方版本。
+
 <div align="center">
 
 # 白 Shirox
@@ -110,6 +116,11 @@ wider grids, and full-screen playback.
 
 ## Modules
 
+This modified source has **Bangumi built in** as a native Home and Search source, and also
+supports **metadata modules** (`type: "metadata"`) for Home, Search and title details,
+separately from playback modules. See [Bangumi and the metadata contract](docs/BANGUMI.md).
+A metadata health check validates metadata modules without requiring a video stream.
+
 Modules are small JSON manifests pointing at a JavaScript file that knows how to search a site and
 resolve streams or chapters. Add one under **Settings → Modules** by pasting its manifest URL.
 
